  "rationale": "The plant models robot perception and motion as a single automaton, capturing all sensor outcomes and motion commands. The specification enforces safe, coverage-biased exploration: move_forward or random_walk in clear, rotate_clockwise for left obstacles, rotate_counterclockwise for right obstacles, move_backward for front obstacles, and full_rotate only after repeated failed recoveries. Recovery states are one-shot and always return to exploration as soon as path_clear is observed.",
  "strategy": [
    "Single plant automaton for combined perception and motion, with helper states for committed actions and recovery.",
    "Specification automaton binds each perception outcome to a unique safe controllable, ensures recovery after obstacles, and prevents unsafe or oscillatory actions."
